---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="FAQ | Daley Organics — Grants Pass, Oregon"
  description="Frequently asked questions about ordering, delivery, bulk pickups, organic certification, and getting the best from your Daley Organics soil."
  canonical="https://daleyorganics.com/faq"
>
  <div class="bg-[#141414] min-h-screen pt-[72px]">
    <!-- Page Header -->
    <div class="bg-[#0e0e0e] border-b border-white/10 py-14">
      <div class="container-custom">
        <p class="eyebrow mb-4">Support</p>
        <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl text-white mb-4">Frequently Asked Questions</h1>
        <p class="text-white/60 text-lg max-w-2xl">
          Quick answers to common questions about ordering, delivery, organic practices, and getting the best performance from your soil.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- FAQ Content -->
    <div class="container-custom py-16 max-w-3xl">

      <!-- Delivery & Orders -->
      <section class="mb-14">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-gold-400 mb-8 pb-3 border-b border-white/10">Delivery &amp; Orders</h2>

        <div class="space-y-8">
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-sans font-semibold text-white mb-2">Do you deliver? What areas do you serve?</h3>
            <p class="text-white/70 leading-relaxed">On bulk orders with special arrangements only. Contact us to discuss your location and order size.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="font-sans font-semibold text-white mb-2">Is there a minimum for bulk orders?</h3>
            <p class="text-white/70 leading-relaxed">10 yards, plus the driver's delivery fee.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="font-sans font-semibold text-white mb-2">Can I pick up instead of delivery?</h3>
            <p class="text-white/70 leading-relaxed">Of course! We are open 9am–5pm Monday through Saturday in Spring and Summer. Call to schedule from Late Summer until early March: <a href="tel:+15414410510" class="text-gold-400 hover:text-gold-300 transition-colors">541-441-0510</a>.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="font-sans font-semibold text-white mb-2">What payment methods do you accept?</h3>
            <p class="text-white/70 leading-relaxed">Cash, Check, Cash App, and Credit Card. Cash is preferred.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="font-sans font-semibold text-white mb-2">What is your return/refund policy?</h3>
            <p class="text-white/70 leading-relaxed">All sales are final. That said, we strive to make our customers happy — if there is an issue, let us know and we will attempt to accommodate reasonable and polite requests.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="font-sans font-semibold text-white mb-2">Are products available year-round?</h3>
            <p class="text-white/70 leading-relaxed">We are only in the office for regular hours during planting season, but you are welcome to call year-round to make arrangements.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Products & Organic Practices -->
      <section class="mb-14">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-gold-400 mb-8 pb-3 border-b border-white/10">Products &amp; Organic Practices</h2>

        <div class="space-y-8">
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-sans font-semibold text-white mb-2">Are your products certified organic?</h3>
            <p class="text-white/70 leading-relaxed">Yes!</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="font-sans font-semibold text-white mb-2">How should I store soil or compost after I buy it?</h3>
            <p class="text-white/70 leading-relaxed">Ideally out of the sun. A tarp over your planting container or raised beds works fine.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="font-sans font-semibold text-white mb-2">Do you make custom soil blends for specific crops or beds?</h3>
            <p class="text-white/70 leading-relaxed">Yes, but generally only for bulk orders due to logistics, time, and cost constraints. If you want to pre-order individual amendments, that is generally something we can accommodate.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="font-sans font-semibold text-white mb-2">What is the pH of your soil mixes?</h3>
            <p class="text-white/70 leading-relaxed">Contact us for current pH specs on specific blends — <a href="tel:+15414410510" class="text-gold-400 hover:text-gold-300 transition-colors">541-441-0510</a>.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Usage -->
      <section class="mb-14">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-gold-400 mb-8 pb-3 border-b border-white/10">Usage &amp; Application</h2>

        <div class="space-y-8">
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-sans font-semibold text-white mb-2">What's the difference between compost and fertilizer blends?</h3>
            <p class="text-white/70 leading-relaxed">Check out our detailed whitepaper and extensive literature at our <a href="/research" class="text-gold-400 hover:text-gold-300 transition-colors">Soil Science Research page</a>.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="font-sans font-semibold text-white mb-2">How much should I apply (beds, top-dressing, containers)?</h3>
            <p class="text-white/70 leading-relaxed">Apply ¼ inch of compost on top of raised beds to introduce healthy bacteria and activate the latent nutrients. See our <a href="/ingredients" class="text-gold-400 hover:text-gold-300 transition-colors">Ingredient Library</a> for amendment-specific guidance.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- CTA -->
      <div class="bg-[#0e0e0e] border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-8 text-center">
        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-white mb-3">Still have questions?</h3>
        <p class="text-white/60 mb-6">We're happy to help. Reach out directly or visit us in Grants Pass.</p>
        <a href="/#contact" class="btn-primary inline-block rounded-sm">Contact Us</a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
